        "@value": "The Big Little Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Three family artists. One stage. Endless fun! Join Beppie, Seeka Sings, and Beth Portman for an unforgettable musical experience that the whole family will enjoy. Live Music, dancing, singing, and crafting right in the heart of the Whitemud Crossing Library. &nbsp; Event cost (free, fixed price or range): $15"
      },
