        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Cosmopolitan Music Society : Latin Dance Party"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "It&#8217;s time to dance! Join the Cosmopolitan Music Society Jazz Big Band, Cosmopolitones, and special guest &#8211; dance instructor extraordinaire- Maxwell Aguilar, in an evening of hot and lively music and dance. Ticket price includes over an hour of dance lessons led by Maxwell and members of his dance school, Caribbean Touch. Showtime: Friday, April&hellip;"
      },
      {
