        "@value": "It&#8217;s time to dance! Join the Cosmopolitan Music Society Jazz Big Band, Cosmopolitones, and special guest &#8211; dance instructor extraordinaire- Maxwell Aguilar, in an evening of hot and lively music&hellip;"
      }
