heck out https://www.abigayleoakley.com/ for more info!&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/abigayle-oakley-albertan-tour/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-20T00:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-02-20T23:59:59-07:00\",\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Swing Dance Party ft. Cosmopolitones, Jazz Big Band, and Sugar Swing Dancers\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Join us for a Swing Dance Party featuring the Cosmopolitones, Jazz Big Band, and the Sugar Swing Dancers. Cosmopolitones\\u00a0conducted by Joel Gray Jazz Big Band\\u00a0conducted by Dale Chapman and showcasing The Sugar Swing Dancers \\u00a0 Friday, February 20th, 2026 Concert at 7 pm (doors at 6 pm) \\u00a0 Tickets: $40 ticket\\u00a0available through Showpass includes 1&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/swing-dance-party-ft-cosmopolitones-jazz-big-band-and-sugar-swing-dancers/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-20T18:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-02-20T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"old strathcona performing arts centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"8426 Gateway Blvd\",\"addressLocality\":\"Edmonton\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"40\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/swing-dance-party-ft-cosmopolitones-jazz-big-band-and-sugar-swing-dancers/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-02-11T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"John Hewitt and Abigayle Oakley &#8211; Analog Books\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/john-hewitt-and-abigayle-oakley-analog-books/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-25T18:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-02-25T20:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"analog books\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"322 6th St\",\"addressLocality\":\"Lethbridge\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"John Hewitt and the New Americans &#8211; Lacombe Performing Arts Centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/john-hewitt-and-the-new-americans-lacombe-performing-arts-centre/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-27T18:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-02-27T20:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"lacombe performing arts centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"5227 Calgary Edmonton Trail\",\"addressLocality\":\"Lacombe\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Jillian Treidler Album Release Party\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Join Jillian Treidler and Social Eyes at the Aviary on Feb 27th to celebrate the release of Jillian\\\\'s debut album - &quot;Death in the Family&quot; &nbsp; Where : The Aviary , Edmonton, AB When : February 27th, 2026&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/jillian-treidler-album-release-party/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-02-27T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"the aviary\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"9314 111 Ave NW, Edmonton, AB T5G 0A3, Canada\",\"addressLocality\":\"Edmonton\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"104 SZN : &#8220;S.A.L.A.K.&#8221; Release Party\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Stop Acting Like a Kid. A soundtrack to growth, pressure, purpose, and staying young at heart. This night will be a celebration of life. EP RELEASE PARTY This night marks the debut of\\u00a0Stop Acting Like Kid, an EP about growing up in real time, navigating life, pressure, and purpose while still holding onto that youthful&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/104-szn-s-a-l-a-k-release-party/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-03-14T18:00:00-06:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-14T20:00:00-06:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"10905 106 Ave\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Edmonton\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Caroline Parke Album Release Party\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Join Caroline Parke for the celebration of her album, &quot;All the Moving Parts&quot; at Edmonton\\\\'s The Rooster &nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/caroline-parke-album-release-party/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-03-28T14:00:00-06:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-28T17:00:00-06:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"the rooster\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"10732 Whyte ave\",\"addressLocality\":\"Edmonton\",\"addressRegion\":\"Alberta\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"The Big Little Concert\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Three family artists. One stage. Endless fun! Join Beppie, Seeka Sings, and Beth Portman for an unforgettable musical experience that the whole family will enjoy. Live Music, dancing, singing, and crafting right in the heart of the Whitemud Crossing Library. &nbsp; Event cost (free, fixed price or\\u00a0range): $15&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/the-big-little-concert/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-04-18T14:00:00-06:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-04-18T18:00:00-06:00\",\"performer\":\"Organization\"}]   {\"slug\":\"list\",\"prev_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.albertamusic.org\\/events\\/list\\/page\\/2\\/?eventDisplay=past\",\"next_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.albertamusic.org\\/events\\/list\\/\",\"view_class\":\"Tribe\\\\Events\\\\Views\\\\V2\\\\Views\\\\List_View\",\"view_slug\":\"list\",\"view_label\":\"List\",\"title\":\"Events Archive - Alberta Music\",\"events\":[15398,15657,15649,15654,15660,15652,15665,15662,15625,15646,15627,15854],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.albertamusic.org\\/events\\/list\\/?eventDisplay=past\",\"url_event_date\":false,\"bar\":{\"keyword\":\"\",\"date\":\"\"},\"today\":\"2026-04-19 00:00:00\",\"now\":\"2026-04-19 20:08:27\",\"home_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.albertamusic.org\",\"rest_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.albertamusic.org\\/wp-json\\/tribe\\/views\\/v2\\/html\",\"rest_method\