mmunity. Come for the food. Stay for the music. Leave with the culture! (Food Included&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/jollof-n-jam/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-06T18:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-06T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"The Grand\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"608 1 St SW, Calgary, AB T2P 1M6, Canada\",\"addressLocality\":\"Calgary\",\"addressRegion\":\"Alberta\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Cosmopolitan Music Society Book Launch\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Cosmopolitan Music Society is very pleased to invite\\u00a0you and a guest to the official launch of our new publication,\\u00a0&quot;I Can\\\\'t - I Have Rehearsal: The Cosmopolitan Music Society Story.&quot;\\u00a0\\u00a0This book seeks to chronicle\\u00a0the remarkable journey of Cosmo, celebrating its achievements, honouring its legacy, and exploring the countless ways\\u00a0it has enriched the lives of Alberta residents&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/cosmopolitan-music-society-book-launch/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-08T18:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-08T20:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"old strathcona performing arts centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"8426 Gateway Blvd\",\"addressLocality\":\"Edmonton\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@t