        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Starting on Feb 20th, Abigayle Oakley sets out on her tour cross Alberta &#8211; Feb 20 &#8211; Edmonton Feb 21 &#8211; Drayton Valley Feb 22 &#8211; Fort Saskatchewan Feb 25- Lethbridge Feb 27- Lacombe Feb 28- Nanton March 1 &#8211; High River &nbsp; Check out https://www.abigayleoakley.com/ for more info!"
