    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.104 SZN : “S.A.L.A.K.” Release PartyMarch 14 @ 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm  « Jillian Treidler Album Release PartyCaroline Parke Album Release Party »    Stop Acting Like a Kid. A soundtrack to growth, pressure, purpose, and staying young at heart. This night will be a celebration of life.EP RELEASE PARTYThis night marks the debut of Stop Acting Like Kid, an EP about growing up in real time, navigating life, pressure, and purpose while still holding onto that youthful energy that makes everything feel possible.We’re treating this like a movie premiere. The EP will be paired with a short film that plays throughout the listening experience, pausing before each song so I can give brief context about where my head was at, what I was going through, and why each track exists. It’s a raw look at the process of figuring life out while chasing the dream of being an artist.Doors open with music playing so people can arrive, settle in, and catch the atmosphere. No rush, just good energy and anticipation.Once everyone’s in:• Snacks & drinks available• Short film + EP playback• Brief storytelling before each song• Immersive, intimate premiere-style settingCome celebrate the start of a new chapter.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   March 14   Time:  6:00 pm - 8:00 pm  Website:  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/104-szn-salakrelease-party-tickets-1982525371755  Venue 10905 106 Ave   Edmonton, AB  + Google Map      « Jillian Treidler Album Release PartyCaroline Parke Album Release Party »   "
      }
    ]
  },
