      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Sinners Cabaret: Halfway to Halloween Celebration lands May 17 at Starlite Room / Temple 🖤 A one-night-only underground cabaret of drag, burlesque, magic, live music, and pop up market! 18+ | Doors 6PM Pay what you can so we can keep live performance accessible. Featuring: @kamivanhalst @jayflairmagic @houseofhushburlesque @thered.silence @rom_dot_com @callmekeeks_ @northofordinaryevents Dark glamour.&hellip;"
