    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events The Sinners CabaretMay 17 @ 6:00 pm - 10:30 pm  « Beltuner : Live in EdmontonCalgary Stampede : Kue Varo »    The Sinners Cabaret: Halfway to Halloween Celebration lands May 17 at Starlite Room / Temple 🖤A one-night-only underground cabaret of drag, burlesque, magic, live music, and pop up market!18+ | Doors 6PM Pay what you can so we can keep live performance accessible.Featuring: @kamivanhalst @jayflairmagic @houseofhushburlesque @thered.silence @rom_dot_com @callmekeeks_ @northofordinaryeventsDark glamour. Live performance. No limits.This is your invitation to step into something different.Tickets on sale now reserve your spot via link in bio!       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   May 17   Time:  6:00 pm - 10:30 pm  Venue Starlite Room   10030 102 Street  Edmonton, Alberta T5J 0V6 Canada  + Google Map      « Beltuner : Live in EdmontonCalgary Stampede : Kue Varo »   "
      }
    ]
  },
