        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.The Big Little ConcertApril 18 @ 2:00 pm - 6:00 pm  « Caroline Parke Album Release PartyCosmopolitan Music Society : Latin Dance Party »    Three family artists. One stage. Endless fun! Join Beppie, Seeka Sings, and Beth Portman for an unforgettable musical experience that the whole family will enjoy. Live Music, dancing, singing, and crafting right in the heart of the Whitemud Crossing Library. Event cost (free, fixed price or range): $15       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   April 18   Time:  2:00 pm - 6:00 pm    « Caroline Parke Album Release PartyCosmopolitan Music Society : Latin Dance Party »   "
