        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events Cosmopolitan Music Society : Latin Dance PartyApril 24 @ 7:00 pm - 10:00 pm  « The Big Little ConcertSamarpan Music and Dance Festival »    It’s time to dance! Join the Cosmopolitan Music Society Jazz Big Band, Cosmopolitones, and special guest – dance instructor extraordinaire- Maxwell Aguilar, in an evening of hot and lively music and dance. Ticket price includes over an hour of dance lessons led by Maxwell and members of his dance school, Caribbean Touch.Showtime: Friday, April 24th from 7 to 10 pm Doors open at 6 pmTickets: $40 general admission available online through Showpass (includes one hour of Latin dance instruction) at OSPAC Old Strathcona Performing Arts Centre 8426 Gateway Blvd. NW, Edmonton, AB       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   April 24   Time:  7:00 pm - 10:00 pm    « The Big Little ConcertSamarpan Music and Dance Festival »   "
      }
    ]
