        "@value": "  12 events found.            [{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"A Perfectly Frank Christmas\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; A Perfectly Frank Christmas with Johnny Summers and the Calgary Jazz Orchestra blends holiday music with the classic sound of Sinatra. \\u00a0This year, special guest Lead Trumpeter, Roger Ingram joins the musicians of the CJO. Expect a blend of favourite songs from past performances and brand-new arrangements made bespoke just for these shows. This&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/a-perfectly-frank-christmas/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-21T00:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-21T23:59:59-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"bella concert hall\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"4825 Mt Royal Gate SW, Calgary, AB T3E 0A3, Canada\",\"addressLocality\":\"calgary\",\"addressRegion\":\"Alberta\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"https://calgaryjazzorchestra.com/\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Album Release Concert : Wendy Gregson with Renee McLachlan\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;featuring : Jeremiah McDade Stew Kirkwood Ian Woodman Bill Hobson Isabella McLachlan Ruby McLachlan&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/album-release-concert-wendy-gregson-with-renee-mclachlan/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-31T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-31T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"old strathcona performing arts centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAdd