        "@value": "  12 events found.            [{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Cosmopolitan Music Society Book Launch\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Cosmopolitan Music Society is very pleased to invite\\u00a0you and a guest to the official launch of our new publication,\\u00a0&quot;I Can\\\\'t - I Have Rehearsal: The Cosmopolitan Music Society Story.&quot;\\u00a0\\u00a0This book seeks to chronicle\\u00a0the remarkable journey of Cosmo, celebrating its achievements, honouring its legacy, and exploring the countless ways\\u00a0it has enriched the lives of Alberta residents&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/cosmopolitan-music-society-book-launch/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-08T18:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-08T20:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"old strathcona performing arts centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"8426 Gateway Blvd\",\"addressLocality\":\"Edmonton\",\"addressRegion\":\"AB\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Navjeevan &#8211; Live Album Release and Art Exhibition\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sunday, December 14 4:00 PM St Anthony District Archives And Meeting Centre 10425 84 Avenue Northwest Appetizers &amp; Refreshments included! The performance features a live band with intentional transitions between songs, spoken storytelling, and moments of reflection that guide the audience through my creation of new life.Alongside the music, the night includes a curated visual&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/navjeevan-live-album-release-and-art-exhibition/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-14T16:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-14T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"st anthonys district archives and meeting centre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"10425 84 Avenue Northwest\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"27.96\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/navjeevan-live-album-release-and-art-exhibition/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"A Perfectly Frank Christmas\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; A Perfectly Frank Christmas with Johnny Summers and the Calgary Jazz Orchestra blends holiday music with the classic sound of Sinatra. \\u00a0This year, special guest Lead Trumpeter, Roger Ingram joins the musicians of the CJO. Expect a blend of favourite songs from past performances and brand-new arrangements made bespoke just for these shows. This&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://www.albertamusic.org/event/a-perfectly-frank-christmas/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-21T00:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-21T23:59:59-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"bella concert hall\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"4825 Mt Royal Gate SW, Calgary, AB T3E 0A3, Canada\",\"addressLocality\":\"calgary\",\"addressRegion\":\"Alberta\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"https://calgaryjazzorchestra.com/\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Album Release Concert : Wendy