efreshments included! The performance features a live band with intentional transitions between songs, spoken storytelling, and moments of reflection that guide the audience through my creation of new life.Alongside the music, the night includes a curated visual…  $27.96    Sun   21    A Perfectly Frank Christmas   December 21, 2025    bella concert hall   4825 Mt Royal Gate SW, Calgary, AB T3E 0A3, Canada, calgary, Alberta, Canada    A Perfectly Frank Christmas with Johnny Summers and the Calgary Jazz Orchestra blends holiday music with the classic sound of Sinatra.  This year, special guest Lead Trumpeter, Roger Ingram joins the musicians of the CJO. Expect a blend of favourite songs from past performances and brand-new arrangements made bespoke just for these shows. This…  January 2026    Sat   31    Album Release Concert : Wendy Gregson with Renee McLachlan   January 31 @ 7:00 pm - 10:00 pm    old strathcona performing arts centre   8426 Gateway Blvd, Edmonton, AB  featuring : Jeremiah McDade Stew Kirkwood Ian Woodman Bill Hobson Isabella McLachlan Ruby McLachlan  February 2026    Wed   11    New Moon Folk Club – Jed and the Valentine and Abigayle Oakley   February 11 @ 8:00 am - 5:00 pm    new moon folk club   10819 71 ave nw, Edmonton, AB  Join Jed and the Valentine and Abigayle Oakley for a double bill performance at the New Moon Folk Club   Sun   15    Flowshine On Tour – Calgary   February 15 @ 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm    Pig & Whistle   4105 4 St NW, Calgary, AB  Join Flowshine at Calgary's Pig & Whistle as they tour Western Canada in promotion of their new track, \"After School at Bobby's House\"   Wed   18    River Valley Sessions – John Hewitt   February 18 @ 6:30 pm - 8:30 pm    little brick   1004 90 St, Edmonton, AB  Join John Hewitt for a house concert and conversation at a River Valley Sessions performance! Tickets on sale now!       Fri   20    Abigayle Oakley Albertan Tour   February 20 Starting on Feb 20th, Abigayle Oakley sets out on her tour cross Alberta - Feb 20 - Edmonton Feb 21 - Drayton Valley Feb 22 - Fort Saskatchewan Feb 25-…   Fri   20    Swing Dance Party ft. Cosmopolitones, Jazz Big Band, and Sugar Swing Dancers   February 20 @ 6:00 pm - 9:00 pm    old strathcona performing arts centre   8426 Gateway Blvd, Edmonton, AB  Join us for a Swing Dance Party featuring the Cosmopolitones, Jazz Big Band, and the Sugar Swing Dancers. Cosmopolitones conducted by Joel Gray Jazz Big Band conducted by Dale Chapman and showcasing…  $40    Wed   25    John Hewitt and Abigayle Oakley – Analog Books   February 25 @ 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm    analog books   322 6th St, Lethbridge, AB     Fri   27    John Hewitt and the New Americans – Lacombe Performing Arts Centre   February 27 @ 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm    lacombe performing arts centre   5227 Calgary Edmonton Trail, Lacombe, AB     Fri   27    Jillian Treidler Album Release Party   February 27 @ 7:00 pm - 9:00 pm    the aviary   9314 111 Ave NW, Edmonton, AB T5G 0A3, Canada, Edmonton, AB  Join Jillian Treidler and Social Eyes at the Aviary on Feb 27th to celebrate the release of Jillian's debut album - \"Death in the Family\"   Where : The Aviary…      Previous Events    Today    Next Events       Subscribe to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Export .ics file   Export Outlook .ics file    ( function () {\n var completed = false;\n function initBreakpoints() {\n if ( completed ) {\n // This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n document.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'function' !== typeof (window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup) ) {\n return;\n }\n var container = do