ic, poetry, and artistic expression…   Sat   25    Beltuner : Live in Edmonton   April 25 @ 7:00 pm - 9:30 pm    fringe theatre   10330 84 Ave NW, edmonton, AB  Where the pulse of Parisian accordion melody meets Gypsy swing and Balkan rhythms collide with Jazz improvisation, Beltuner takes you on a vibrant and unforgettable musical adventure. Don't miss out…  May 2026    Sun   17    The Sinners Cabaret   May 17 @ 6:00 pm - 10:30 pm    Starlite Room   10030 102 Street, Edmonton, Alberta, Canada  The Sinners Cabaret: Halfway to Halloween Celebration lands May 17 at Starlite Room / Temple 🖤 A one-night-only underground cabaret of drag, burlesque, magic, live music, and pop up market!…  July 2026    Sun   5    Calgary Stampede : Kue Varo   July 5 @ 7:00 pm - 7:30 pm Catch Alberta Music member Kue Varo opening for Boy Golden and Our Lady Peace on July 5th at the Coca Cola Stage !      Previous Events    Today    Next Events       Subscribe to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Export .ics file   Export Outlook .ics file    ( function () {\n var completed = false;\n function initBreakpoints() {\n if ( completed ) {\n // This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n document.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints ) {\n return;\n }\n if ( 'function' !== typeof (window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup) ) {\n return;\n }\n var container = document.querySelectorAll( '[data-view-breakpoint-pointer=\"bdf9f5d7-06c4-45cc-a319-8c7bdad49bad\"]' );\n if ( ! container ) {\n return;\n }\n window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup( container );\n completed = true;\n // This was fired already and completed no n