        "@id": "https://www.albertamusic.org/event/the-mcgowan-family-band/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.The McGowan Family BandJune 27, 2025 @ 8:00 pm - 11:30 pm $10  « Creeping Death & Kruelty w/ Upon Stone & Dying RemainsThe Rubber Bullys »    Get ready, Edmonton! On June 27, 2025, at 8:00 PM, the legendary McGowan Family Band is coming to High Note Bar and Grill to light up the night with their soulful Roots/Americana sound. Since 1999, MFB has been crafting heartfelt songs and filling dance floors all across western Canada. Known for their rich vocal harmonies, spontaneous improvisations, and ever-evolving setlists, every show is a fresh experience!🎸 Featuring: • Paul McGowan – Guitar & Vocals • Mark McGowan – Drums & Vocals • Sean McGowan – Guitar & Vocals • Sean Brewer – Guitar & Vocals • Jason Kodie – Organ, Keyboards & Vocals • Ryan Holmes – Bass & VocalsThey’re also gearing up to release a brand-new studio recording in 2025, so don’t miss your chance to catch them live! Come early and enjoy delicious food specials and your favorite drinks. $10 Cover Charge High Note Bar and Grill – 12315 118 Ave, Edmonton Extra parking available in the back, across the alley, and on side streets. Bring your friends and join us for an unforgettable night of roots, rhythm, and great vibes!       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   June 27, 2025   Time:  8:00 pm - 11:30 pm  Cost:  $10  Website:  https://www.facebook.com/events/746952674556462/?acontext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22discovery_top_tab%22%2C%22surface%22%3A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D  Venue High Note Bar & Grill   12315 118 Avenue  Edmonton, Alberta T5L 2K2 Canada  + Google Map      « Creeping Death & Kruelty w/ Upon Stone & Dying RemainsThe Rubber Bullys »   "
      }
    ]
  },
