    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Sunday Funk JamJune 29, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 11:30 pm Free  « The Rubber BullysDaring Greatly w/ Jade Elephant »    HELLO REVIVALITES! Come down and funk out with us at the River City Revival House every Sunday. Because FUNK WORK, it’s still the weekend! This funkalicious event starts at 7PM, and goes til 12PM! Our house band is the incredible, unstoppable and you better believe they provide a full backline of guitar amps, bass amp, keyboard, drum kit including breakables and a percussion rig! Brought to you by our friends at Coors, grab an Original or Light all night long for $5.50! With all this gear and sauce, the epic funky jams will be unstoppable! Just bring your axe, horn, or voice and yourself, and let’s make some music to move and groove to! All that’s missing is YOU!       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   June 29, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 11:30 pm  Cost:  Free  Website:  https://www.facebook.com/events/4064106350585276/4064106387251939/?active_tab=about  Venue River City Revival   10030 102 Street  Edmonton, Alberta T5J 0V6 Canada  + Google Map      « The Rubber BullysDaring Greatly w/ Jade Elephant »   "
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.albertamusic.org/temporary/ab438174-7361-415c-baa9-00728beff909",
    "@type": [
