    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Wind Up To Wind Down Pt 2June 23, 2025 @ 8:00 am - 5:00 pm $20  Creeping Death & Kruelty w/ Upon Stone & Dying Remains »    We had so much fun last weekend we figured why not Wind Up 2 Wind Down one more time. Featuring more of your favorite artists from this years stacked lineup , and a second chance to WIN your way in – with a second giveaway including 2 Adult Wknd Passes, 2 Youth Passes & an RV Pass (Estimated Value over $600)GetDown YEG & West Cove Recordings proudly present Part 2 featuring performances by KVROT // KITZU // ODDBEAR // DJ JUUCY // FERAL HEARTS REZIDNT FUNK // YEAH MOZZA // GOLDI LOX // BAL_DSaturday June 28th // The Faculty 10151 – Whyte (82) Avenue 9PM SHOW // DOORS $11 Early Birds $15 Adv $20 DoorFundraising event – all proceeds go directly to helping us create the magic and setting for The Wind Down Music & Arts Festival Tickets available online now at getdownyeg.ca       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   June 23, 2025   Time:  8:00 am - 5:00 pm  Cost:  $20  Website:  https://www.facebook.com/events/1065059032391052/?acontext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22discovery_local_tab%22%2C%22surface%22%3A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D  Venue The Faculty   10151 82 Ave NW  Edmonton, Alberta T6E 1Z5 Canada  + Google Map      Creeping Death & Kruelty w/ Upon Stone & Dying Remains »   "
      }
    ]
  },
