    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Alberta Culture Days in Old StrathconaSeptember 20, 2025 - September 21, 2025 Free  « Matthew and the Keys Album Release PartyBreakout West 2025 »    FREE FAMILY FRIENDLY EVENTSaturday & Sunday, September 20th & 21st, from 11 am to 2:30 pm each day in and around McIntyre Park, 104 Street and 83 Avenue Strathcona Performing Arts Association (SPAA) invites you to celebrate Alberta Culture Days in Old Strathcona.  Free family-friendly, cultural activities include:Live Music from Yardbird Suite’s Little Birds Cosmopolitan Music Society ensembles African Music Academy of Canada Singer songwriters (tbs) Active visual arts in the Gazebo by Art Walk & The Paint Spot Curated performances at the Old Strathcona Farmers Market followed by bannock-making workshops Behind the scenes tours of Walterdale & Varscona Theatres and more…       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Start:   September 20, 2025   End:   September 21, 2025   Cost:  Free    « Matthew and the Keys Album Release PartyBreakout West 2025 »   "
      }
    ]
  },
