        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Dahlia Wakefield’s Single Release PartyOctober 11, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 11:00 pm  « WOODHAWK ‘Love Finds a Way’ TourThe Existence Album Launch »    Single release party for Dahlia Wakefield’s new release : ‘Well Dressed Lies’Single Available on all streaming platforms September 26, 2025       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   October 11, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 11:00 pm  Venue Blue’s on Whyte   10329 82 Ave  Edmonton, AB  + Google Map      « WOODHAWK ‘Love Finds a Way’ TourThe Existence Album Launch »   "
