    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.CIMA Label SummitNovember 3, 2025 @ 10:00 am - 4:00 pm  « Weird Halloween Party YYCShip Hop Fall Showcase »    The inaugural Label Summit brought together 24 Canadian independent labels for the first peer-driven event of its kind. Feedback was overwhelmingly positive, and this year we are expanding the Summit into an annual fixture. As part of Make It Music and in collaboration with WIN (Worldwide Independent Network), we’ll also be inviting approximately eight international record labels to join, deepening opportunities for global collaboration with Ontario and Canadian companies.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 3, 2025   Time:  10:00 am - 4:00 pm  Venue Parkdale Hall   Toronto, ON  + Google Map      « Weird Halloween Party YYCShip Hop Fall Showcase »   "
      }
    ]
  },
