    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Village Sessions – Kensington Sinfonia x KTheChosenOctober 23, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 10:00 pm  « GEDFestCosmopolitan Music Society presents: Gratitude – A Concert of Thanksgiving and Remembrance »    Kensington Sinfonia and Village Brewery team up for a unique set of Village Sessions with sweeping strings and sensational collaborative sessions with guest artists. This October, their artist feature will be Calgary lyricist, KTheChosen!       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   October 23, 2025   Time:  7:30 pm - 10:00 pm  Website:  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/kthechosen-tickets-1415337605879  Venue village brewery   5000 12A Street Southeast  Calgary, AB  + Google Map      « GEDFestCosmopolitan Music Society presents: Gratitude – A Concert of Thanksgiving and Remembrance »   "
      }
    ]
