    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Ship Hop Fall ShowcaseNovember 5, 2025 @ 8:00 pm - 10:00 pm  « CIMA Label SummitTim Isberg – Live at the National Music Centre and The King Eddy »    Ship Hop is a quarterly hip-hop showcase that not only highlights upcoming Calgary acts but also provides a platform for those who want to sharpen their pen through open mic or test their freestyle skills during our rap games and cypher. This month’s artists are Nick Wise, Kindé, Tanajah (NYC) and Hip Hip Thursday.Admission is free and there are prizes to be won during the rap challenges so come show us what you’ve got or come cheer on your favourite acts! Free event (18+ admission)       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 5, 2025   Time:  8:00 pm - 10:00 pm  Website:  https://www.facebook.com/share/1CWN7Svtqa/   Venue The Ship & Anchor   534 17 Ave SW  Calgary, AB  + Google Map      « CIMA Label SummitTim Isberg – Live at the National Music Centre and The King Eddy »   "
      }
    ]
  },
