    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Brother Bicker Band – The Good Road Release ShowOctober 23, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 10:00 pm  « GEDFestCosmopolitan Music Society presents: Gratitude – A Concert of Thanksgiving and Remembrance »    Southern Alberta, get ready to light up your Thursday night! On Thursday, October 23, 2025, The King Eddy hosts The Brother Bicker Band’s The Good Road Tour to celebrate the release of the band’s upcoming single, The Good Road, released to all digital platforms on October 24th! Along with their signature maple whiskey rock n’ roll—gritty guitars, big harmonies, and sing-along hooks – the band is celebrating with their good friends, Alberta alt-country legends, the Cody Hall Band.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   October 23, 2025   Time:  7:30 pm - 10:00 pm  Venue The King Eddy   438 9 Avenue SE  Calgary, AB  + Google Map      « GEDFestCosmopolitan Music Society presents: Gratitude – A Concert of Thanksgiving and Remembrance »   "
      }
    ]
  },
