    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.‘Just Another Day’ Single Release ShowNovember 15, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 10:30 pm $25  « Paul Woida Live at Festival PlaceJoe Nolan Album Release : Luv in the New World »    Join local artists Jason Andrew Griffith, Melyssa Lee, and Paul Zacharias as they celebrate the release of their single collaboration “Stay Another Day”! This intimate and unforgettable evening will feature a blend of folk and Americana music in the storyteller-friendly “songwriter-in-the-round” format. You’ll hear solo originals and covers from all three artists and also get to see them team up on some group performances for the first time.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 15, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 10:30 pm  Cost:  $25  Website:  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/stay-another-day-single-release-show-tickets-1711260108049  Venue cornerstone music cafe   139 14919 Deer Ridge Drive SE  calgary, AB  + Google Map    « Paul Woida Live at Festival PlaceJoe Nolan Album Release : Luv in the New World »   "
      }
    ]
  },
