    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.‘The Way We Were’ with Timothy NoelNovember 8, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 10:00 pm  « SYNC : Sound and Image ConferenceNatalie Inga & The Ladybros EP Release Party »    TiMiNo Entertainment proudly presents The Way We Were, an unforgettable night of music featuring Edmonton’s own Timothy Noel and his band, The RearViews. The concert supports Ronald McDonald House Charities (RMHC) Alberta, with $5 from every ticket directly benefiting the charity. The evening will also mark the release of Timothy Noel’s first professional single, “Right Here.”       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 8, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 10:00 pm  Website:  https://festivalplace.ca/events/the-way-we-were/  Venue festival place   Sherwood Park, AB  + Google Map      « SYNC : Sound and Image ConferenceNatalie Inga & The Ladybros EP Release Party »   "
      }
    ]
  },
