    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Paul Woida Live at Festival PlaceNovember 14, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 9:00 pm $22.00 – $27.00  « Natalie Inga & The Ladybros EP Release Party‘Just Another Day’ Single Release Show »    Paul Woida is a one-man band who uses live looping to deliver the power and dynamics of a full band. After nearly signing with a major label in Nashville, he chose to forge his own path and release music independently. Just one year into his independent journey, Paul has already earned over 1.1 million streams. Known for his electrifying live looping performances, Paul delivers a concert experience that feels bigger than one man should be able to create.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 14, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 9:00 pm  Cost:  $22.00 – $27.00  Website:  https://www.showpass.com/paul-woida-live-at-festival-place/  Venue festival place   Sherwood Park, AB  + Google Map      « Natalie Inga & The Ladybros EP Release Party‘Just Another Day’ Single Release Show »   "
      }
    ]
  },
