        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Matthew and the KeysNovember 15, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 10:00 pm $10 – $20.00  « Paul Woida Live at Festival PlaceJoe Nolan Album Release : Luv in the New World »    MATTHEW AND THE KEYS, LIVE AT @nakedcybercafe ! Come on down and sing, dance and groove with us. Go to the link in my bio for tickets to the show. This one is ALL AGES! 7 pm doors, 8 pm for the show!Advanced tickets: $10.00 for kids under 12 years old, $15.00 general admission for everyone else 13 years old and above!$20.00 at the door.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 15, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 10:00 pm  Cost:  $10 – $20.00  Venue naked cyber cafe   10303 108 St NW  Edmonton, AB  + Google Map      « Paul Woida Live at Festival PlaceJoe Nolan Album Release : Luv in the New World »   "
