        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Westmore Single Release CelebrationNovember 22, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 10:30 pm $20 – $25  « Joe Nolan Album Release : Luv in the New WorldRise for Jamaica – A Benefit Concert for Hurricane Relief »    Westmore’s ‘Be Around’ Single Release Celebration w/ support from Addison Wall!Joined by John Hewitt & Connor Miskiman, Westmore is celebrating the release of his newest single ‘Be Around’ at Felice Cafe with an acoustic trio!This show will mark a new era of Westmore’s journey as he reimagines songs from his previous EP, showing off unreleased tunes, and of course—celebrating the newest single!November 22ndDoors @ 7:00pmFelice Cafe$20 Advance, $25 at the door       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 22, 2025   Time:  7:00 pm - 10:30 pm  Cost:  $20 – $25  Website:  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/saturday-november-22-westmore-single-release-tickets-1918501572849?aff=oddtdtcreator  Venue felice cafe   10930 84 St NW  Edmonton, AB  + Google Map      « Joe Nolan Album Release : Luv in the New WorldRise for Jamaica – A Benefit Concert for Hurricane Relief »   "
