    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Rise for Jamaica – A Benefit Concert for Hurricane ReliefNovember 23, 2025  « Westmore Single Release CelebrationJollof N Jam »    Rise for Jamaica is a collaboration of artists across the city with JANA (Jamaica Association of Northern Alberta) to help bring awareness and help raise funds to those across the country of Jamaica in need. Saint & The Full100 BandSkyStarTimothy NoelMelafriqueCrystal ReidMykal ReadAll proceeds go directly to hurricane Melissa reliefmore details to come       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   November 23, 2025   Website:  https://www.instagram.com/p/DQdBt8wATKV/?igsh=OHFkcXB1MjQ1aDRi  Venue Union Hall   Edmonton, Alberta  + Google Map      « Westmore Single Release CelebrationJollof N Jam »   "
      }
    ]
