    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Jollof N JamDecember 6, 2025 @ 6:00 pm - 10:00 pm  « Rise for Jamaica – A Benefit Concert for Hurricane ReliefCosmopolitan Music Society Book Launch »    Jollof N Jams where Afro-Caribbean culture takes center stage and Alberta’s rising Afro-Fusion stars light up The Grand. This year, 3rd Verse Record’s are celebrating the release of LYFE — the groundbreaking, genre-bending Afro-Fusion album redefining Calgary’s sound, spirit, and community. Come for the food. Stay for the music. Leave with the culture!(Food Included In Ticket Price)        Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   December 6, 2025   Time:  6:00 pm - 10:00 pm  Website:  https://www.thegrandyyc.ca/jollofnjam  Venue The Grand   608 1 St SW, Calgary, AB T2P 1M6, Canada  Calgary, Alberta Canada  + Google Map      « Rise for Jamaica – A Benefit Concert for Hurricane ReliefCosmopolitan Music Society Book Launch »   "
      }
    ]
