      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Cosmopolitan Music Society Book LaunchDecember 8, 2025 @ 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm  « Jollof N JamNavjeevan – Live Album Release and Art Exhibition »    Cosmopolitan Music Society is very pleased to invite you and a guest to the official launch of our new publication, “I Can’t – I Have Rehearsal: The Cosmopolitan Music Society Story.”  This book seeks to chronicle the remarkable journey of Cosmo, celebrating its achievements, honouring its legacy, and exploring the countless ways it has enriched the lives of Alberta residents over the past 60 years.On Monday, December 8th from 6 to 8 pm, please join us for some live music, refreshments, and an introduction to the new book !  Authors Dr. Jan Olson and Dr. Taina Lorenz will be present to discuss the book, answer questions, and sign copies, if so desired.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   December 8, 2025   Time:  6:00 pm - 8:00 pm  Venue old strathcona performing arts centre   8426 Gateway Blvd  Edmonton, AB  + Google Map      « Jollof N JamNavjeevan – Live Album Release and Art Exhibition »   "
      }
    ]
  },
