    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.Navjeevan – Live Album Release and Art ExhibitionDecember 14, 2025 @ 4:00 pm - 10:00 pm $27.96  « Cosmopolitan Music Society Book LaunchA Perfectly Frank Christmas »    Sunday, December 14 4:00 PM St Anthony District Archives And Meeting Centre 10425 84 Avenue NorthwestAppetizers & Refreshments included! The performance features a live band with intentional transitions between songs, spoken storytelling, and moments of reflection that guide the audience through my creation of new life.Alongside the music, the night includes a curated visual art exhibition by Calgary based visual artist, Alex Carreon — original collage, print, and mixed-media works that expand the world of Navjeevan. Album artwork prints will be available for purchase.To further immerse guests into the Navjeevan experience, art supplies will be available to create your own collages as you listen. This is also intentionally available to engage children and youth and anyone who likes to keep their hands busy!After the performance there will be an artist talk and Q&A about the creative process and collaboration between myself and Alex explaining how the music and visual art came together.       Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   December 14, 2025   Time:  4:00 pm - 10:00 pm  Cost:  $27.96  Website:   https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/navjeevan-album-release-live-art-exhibit-tickets-1976425703483?aff=oddtdtcreator  Venue st anthonys district archives and meeting centre   10425 84 Avenue Northwest  + Google Map    « Cosmopolitan Music Society Book LaunchA Perfectly Frank Christmas »   "
      }
    ]
  },
