    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  « All Events This event has passed.A Perfectly Frank ChristmasDecember 21, 2025  « Navjeevan – Live Album Release and Art ExhibitionAlbum Release Concert : Wendy Gregson with Renee McLachlan »     A Perfectly Frank Christmas with Johnny Summers and the Calgary Jazz Orchestra blends holiday music with the classic sound of Sinatra.  This year, special guest Lead Trumpeter, Roger Ingram joins the musicians of the CJO. Expect a blend of favourite songs from past performances and brand-new arrangements made bespoke just for these shows. This holiday tradition is enjoyable for people of all ages as they celebrate the season.First show is at 3:00pm, Second show is at 7:00pm         Add to calendar      Google Calendar   iCalendar   Outlook 365   Outlook Live   Details Date:   December 21, 2025   Website:   https://calgaryjazzorchestra.com/   Venue bella concert hall   4825 Mt Royal Gate SW, Calgary, AB T3E 0A3, Canada  calgary, Alberta Canada  + Google Map   View Venue Website      « Navjeevan – Live Album Release and Art ExhibitionAlbum Release Concert : Wendy Gregson with Renee McLachlan »   "
      }
